10. LLVM OpenMP runtime (libomp.so)

    Authors:  The LLVM Project contributors
    License:  Apache License, Version 2.0 with LLVM exceptions (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception).
              The texts are in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt and licenses/LLVM-exception.txt.
    Source:   libomp.so from the Android NDK (lib/clang/<version>/lib/linux/aarch64), copied by
              the Android build. The NDK's own license terms cover the NDK.

    Use in echoir-core
    - ggml's OpenMP links libomp.so on Android, and Android does not ship it. The Android archive
      (echoir-<version>-android-arm64.zip) and the android-arm64 assets of the Echoir.Core NuGet
      package contain it beside the echoir libraries.

11. Microsoft Visual C++ runtime

    Files:    vcruntime140.dll, vcruntime140_1.dll, msvcp140.dll, vcomp140.dll
    License:  Microsoft Visual Studio redistributable files, under the Visual Studio license terms
    Source:   the Visual Studio redistributable folder, copied by tools/package-windows.ps1

    Use in echoir-core
    - The Windows echoir archives (echoir-<version>-windows-cpu-x64.zip and
      echoir-<version>-windows-vulkan-x64.zip) contain them, so echoir.exe runs without the Visual
